:: Start
<<if $gameStarted>>
  # Restart Game?
  
  You've already started a game. Would you like to restart?
  
  <<link "Yes, restart the game">>
    <<run gameUtils.resetGameState()>>
    <<goto "Start">>
  <</link>>
  
  <<link "No, continue my current game">>
    <<goto "CurrentAge">>
  <</link>>
<<else>>
  <<set $gameStarted to true>>
  
  <div class="title-screen">
    # Warmth of Tribe
    
    <div class="season-indicator season-summer">A Paleolithic Survival Journey</div>
    
    <p>In a time before written history, when humans lived in small nomadic tribes and survival depended on the knowledge passed down through generations, you will experience a life from childhood to old age.</p>
    
    <p>Your choices will shape your skills, relationships, and the legacy you leave behind for your tribe.</p>
    
    <<link "Begin Your Journey">>
      <<goto "LanguageSelection">>
    <</link>>
  </div>
<</if>>

:: LanguageSelection
# Choose Your Language

<p>The language of your tribe will influence certain cultural aspects and naming conventions throughout your journey.</p>

<<link "Proto-Indo-European">>
  <<set $language to "proto-indo-european">>
  <<goto "GenderSelection">>
<</link>>

<<link "Proto-Uralic">>
  <<set $language to "proto-uralic">>
  <<goto "GenderSelection">>
<</link>>

<<link "Proto-Afroasiatic">>
  <<set $language to "proto-afroasiatic">>
  <<goto "GenderSelection">>
<</link>>

<div class="language-info">
  <p><strong>Note:</strong> This choice is primarily for flavor and will affect names and certain cultural elements. All languages provide the same gameplay experience.</p>
</div>

:: GenderSelection
# Choose Your Gender

<p>In your tribe, different genders often have different roles and expectations, though individuals can sometimes challenge these norms.</p>

<<link "Female">>
  <<set $character to {
    gender: "female",
    name: "",
    age: 3,
    lifeStage: "childhood",
    traits: [],
    experiences: []
  }>>
  <<goto "NameSelection">>
<</link>>

<<link "Male">>
  <<set $character to {
    gender: "male",
    name: "",
    age: 3,
    lifeStage: "childhood",
    traits: [],
    experiences: []
  }>>
  <<goto "NameSelection">>
<</link>>

:: NameSelection
# Choose Your Name

<p>Your name will be how others in the tribe know you. Names often reflect natural elements, animals, or desired traits.</p>

<<if $language eq "proto-indo-european">>
  <<if $character.gender eq "female">>
    <<link "Alka (Elk)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Alka">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Bhāgā (Good Fortune)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Bhāgā">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Pria (Beloved)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Pria">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <<else>>
    <<link "Wlkwos (Wolf)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Wlkwos">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Dyēus (Sky)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Dyēus">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Weidos (Wise)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Weidos">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <</if>>
<<elseif $language eq "proto-uralic">>
  <<if $character.gender eq "female">>
    <<link "Lumi (Snow)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Lumi">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Päivä (Sun)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Päivä">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Metsä (Forest)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Metsä">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <<else>>
    <<link "Kala (Fish)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Kala">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Otso (Bear)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Otso">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Tuli (Fire)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Tuli">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<if $character.gender eq "female">>
    <<link "Neith (Water)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Neith">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Amunet (Hidden One)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Amunet">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Satet (Shooter)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Satet">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <<else>>
    <<link "Horus (Falcon)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Horus">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Khnum (Creator)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Khnum">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
    
    <<link "Amun (Hidden)">>
      <<set $character.name to "Amun">>
      <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
    <</link>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

<<link "Choose a custom name">>
  <<goto "CustomName">>
<</link>>

:: CustomName
# Enter Your Name

<p>What name would you like to be known by in your tribe?</p>

<<textbox "$customName" "">>

<<link "Confirm Name">>
  <<if $customName>>
    <<set $character.name to $customName>>
    <<goto "ChildhoodIntro">>
  <<else>>
    <<goto "CustomName">>
  <</if>>
<</link>>

<<link "Go back to name selection">>
  <<goto "NameSelection">>
<</link>>